    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the park of lights and cheer,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Jinx the clown was loved so dear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But envy\u2019s shadows crept so near,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He was murdered filled with despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Returning from midnight\u2019s sphere,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his bloody hammer turned joy into fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grandma told me,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what was hidden behind smiles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >were tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292510/extras/ebd0e86d0243b2d034d4dbf7c29520d2.avif?t=1742234763\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is the game about:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today is your first day working at this amusement park. You have only one job: to work the night shift. However, everything seems far from simple: the noisy radio, the always-disconnected phone, and a fog that envelops the amusement park, filling the air with a spooky and disturbing atmosphere. Have you heard that terrifying story? A friendly clown was killed instead and became evil! They say he's still roaming around... Shhh, better be cautious. Remember, the security booth is the only safe place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person horror game, immersive experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple scenes with different mechanisms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich light and sound effects to enhance the immersion of the horror amusement park.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back against your enemies, no longer just hiding!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292510/extras/78b0dc3967af54708d7ac5ceb748461d.avif?t=1742234763\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is created by <strong>@radiosity</strong> with YAHAHA Horror Game Kit and YAHAHA assists the creator with packaging and publishing the game based on their request. Yahaha Horror Gamekit is tailored for imaginative creators and players who adore horror games, all without the need for any programming expertise.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292510/extras/e8faae212f616c89645360225bd67af1.avif?t=1742234763\" width=720 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
